




    Bombs movements.

When a bomb which is moving collides with another one, then movement
energy is transmitted to each other. 


    Push-Bombs

You can collect the push-bombs, which permits you to push the bombs
by walking in direction of bombs you want to push !
If you are behind a column of many bombs, you can push them by
doing as many up-down or left-right movements as there are bombs.


    "Maladies":

When you are ill, you can transmit the "maladie" to other players
by touching them. When you do that, you give your remaining time to
the other player and your "maladie" time is divided by two.
So be careful when you have invincibility one !
Then only bonus you can give without time decreasing is speed-up one.



